FORCED-ARC DESCENT (HYP-8270): cap_P Gamma_P = coordinate subspace on arcs
lying on EVERY Hamiltonian path of T (base-path-independent by construction).
Naive cap over all paths of K_n = 0 for n >= 4 (no universal edge) — the invariant
lives on T's own path system.  Descent: contract forced arcs, iterate -> core.
